    {
      "body": "@Qiaolin-Yu \r\nHi, could you please help take a look at this EPLB fix and tag it with run-ci if it looks good?\r\n\r\nDynamic EPLB currently fails when migrating torch.float8_e8m0fnu tensors because NCCL P2P does not accept this dtype directly. This PR uses a zero-copy uint8 view only for transport, without conversion or changing the underlying tensor contents.\r\n\r\nThe change is limited to the EPLB migration path and includes a CPU regression test for storage sharing, byte preservation, receive-side writes, and unchanged behavior for supported dtypes. I also verified dynamic EPLB end-to-end on H20.\r\n\r\nThanks!",
